      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:167dem3'
    '|a||То́чка: the voice falls on рестора́н, and stays down. Э́то мой рестора́н.':
